00:07:35.654 --> 00:07:39.225 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> to the Royal Navy's one
 hundred and fifty.</i>

00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:42.194 align:start size:88% position:13%
PROF. GROVE: Scheer's
original plan was to
come out with his fleet,

00:07:42.227 --> 00:07:49.034 align:start size:97% position:3%
