 victory for the Royal Navy.</i>

00:09:10.682 --> 00:09:19.625 align:start position:0%
<i> Around four thirty pm on May
 31st, the two fleets sight each
 other and the Germans open fire</i>

00:09:19.658 --> 00:09:25.364
<i> Over the next twelve hours
 Jutland becomes the biggest
 sea battle of world war one.</i>

00:09:25.397 --> 00:09:29.335
<i> But what exactly happens is
 still shrouded in mystery.</i>

00:09:30.302 --> 00:09:36.141 align:start size:97% position:3%
