Could this be a gun?
MAN: Yeah you can see the gun.

00:10:17.716 --> 00:10:21.920 align:start size:94% position:6%
JELLICOE: One of the barrels.
MAN: It's upside down.

00:10:21.953 --> 00:10:25.157 align:start size:84% position:16%
<i> NARRATOR: First they
 locate two gun turrets.</i>

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:28.661 align:start size:81% position:19%
<i> But where is the
 ship they come from?</i>

00:10:28.694 --> 00:10:30.362 align:start size:84% position:16%
JELLICOE: Look at this!
Look at this!

00:10:30.395 --> 00:10:31.931 align:start size:78% position:22%
I think we've found
something here.

00:10:36.735 --> 00:10:43.842 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> NARRATOR: It's now
 possible to drain the
 waters of the North Sea,</i>

00:10:43.875 --> 00:10:52.685 align:start position:0%
<i> not only revealing the wreck of
 invincible, but also evidence o
 the explosive violence of its
 final moments.</i>

