00:11:14.172 --> 00:11:21.714 align:start position:0%
<i> Such is the explosive force tha
 wrecks the ship that its gun
 turrets lie almost four hundred
 feet away.</i>

00:11:21.747 --> 00:11:27.820
<i> The power of the blast
 must have blown them
 clean out of the ship.</i>

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:29.488
JELLICOE: You know how
much these things weigh?

