These are about
sort of 200 tons.

00:11:31.823 --> 00:11:36.195 align:start position:0%
Can you imagine the violence and
the force of this explosion?
SURVEYOR: Amazing, isn't it?

00:11:36.228 --> 00:11:39.732 align:start size:78% position:22%
JELLICOE: It's,
it's extraordinary.

