<i> NARRATOR: The hull is broken
 at the spot where Invincible's
 two central gun turrets</i>

00:11:43.869 --> 00:11:48.907 align:start size:88% position:13%
<i> are connected to the
 ammunition stores below.</i>

00:11:48.940 --> 00:11:53.879 align:start size:91% position:9%
<i> What does this reveal about
